# Local tool/runtime artifacts (any subfolder)
.codex
**/.codex/
**/._*
**/MUJOCO_LOG.TXT

# Backend temp XML emitted next to robot.xml (motrix/mujoco scene materialization)
src/unilab/assets/robots/**/tmp*.xml

# --- issue-627 LiDAR demo inputs: tracked on purpose ---
# Bundled scene/model XMLs, ONNX policies and the mid360 scan pattern used by the
# self-contained demos scripts/lidar_{go2,g1}_demo.py. These are demo INPUTS, not
# training artifacts, so they are explicitly whitelisted here (overriding any
# broad ignore) while the rules above keep checkpoints/motions/caches untracked.
# Robot meshes are NOT vendored: the demo XMLs reference src/unilab/assets/robots.
!scripts/lidar_demo_assets/
!scripts/lidar_demo_assets/**
